    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 31a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hine man æniges ðinges téo, andswarie innan ðam hundrede ðær he on byclypod béo, swa hit lagu séo.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if any accusation is brought against one of them, he shall answer [it], in accordance with the law, within the hundred in which he is accused.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hine man æniges þingces teo, andswarie innan þam hundrede, þær he on beclypod beo, swa hit rihtlagu sig.</ab>
      </div>
